    feat(qa4-E0,qa4-img5): build version badge + real AI credits usage
    
    - E0: vite injects __BUILD_INFO__ {commit, builtAt} (git rev-parse);
      muted badge data-testid=app-version at the bottom of the Sidebar so
      reviewers can verify the deployed build matches git.
    - img5 FE side: the hardcoded '12,480 / 25,000 used' is replaced by
      GET /api/v1/credits/summary/ {used_month, quota_month} rendered via
      t('sidebar.creditsUsage', {used, quota}) with Intl formatting; null
      quota shows 'N used'; API failure falls back to the static text
      (Sidebar.vue, credits.ts).
    - buildInfo.test.ts (4), credits.test.ts (2), Sidebar.test.ts (4).

